    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c20816f3d714e7b8c62722d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还是老样子，精准到分。不过……呵，倒也不坏。\n凡事按自己的计算行事……这对获胜而言至关重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac99c44ab6a86fe17b1279435db0a4b465d5b4945714a0b5bd40d1b7e626cc98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
