    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:473395627d355252b445523a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀。她也是下一届经典赛线上的有力候补。据说她冷静沉着、\n绝不错过瞬间战机的特质，与她那犀利的末脚简直是绝配。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2238918bd714b18f6786fa7461a0c5913d20b08b2aee9d844258dc432f959134",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cdff9d52b38ac10951b0f4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "站在比萨胜驹身旁的是……玫瑰帝国。\n作为名门『蔷薇一族』的出身，她是同期中屈指可数的实力派。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8473adcc6c89c1a061bcbff83c82964f9500be85d1cecf5e240f6002e9db146",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90ac4970502ffd8ab40515d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀",
      "source_fingerprint": "dddbabf0a14340be785a6989ad9c1b0d7af7714ae783df71e025920875aeeda6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78eee7fcae7a4f110349470f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——比萨同学。我一直以来都很关注你的奔跑。\n今天我会全力以赴与你较量的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2398cca6f23915a702a2d9bc0d15687e6dae8c3c16afc1440e8b525786a9d701",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef4e41506358aa1d1935602c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09bd33b784cbd99ed57a0147",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哼哼……为了不让你失望，我会努力的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3557121b8386b193cb8724d927a8587d77a9fa3f546a037be4143df81f5d3322",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed95cbb8321dd08121e955ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她……究竟是为了追求什么而奔跑呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a89ebee1708294920ee5f83406ab79f69a7c65fdf5f3ddf30208bd9c58f34e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ffd0a61413bf39f4a89757",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着被极具个性的成员所包围的比萨胜驹，\n我突然产生了一个念头。那就是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "812262574fa9f710b881334d055f3599e8dcf7f887f8b2f828c4adeb3d2a4f6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb7c4c86ed84030b8501dd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那孩子，总感觉和她们有些不一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c7419d291c7616b65899610de73ba3ae0f47b58dbbb75d50974fe97a9d9b76e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5606bba8a6d1cbd3b200f305",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『身为向族人证明荣耀的王者』『支配比赛的全局』。\n像她的对手们一样，大家通常都有明确的目标——",
      "source_fingerprint": "344d6573b43dbb778c69ebc66431f97060babd0536a98ddb68f8224f1b091c29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6e50436db394aa0609db65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然或许是受她那软绵绵的外表氛围影响，\n但我总觉得，她心里似乎藏着某种与明确目标不同的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd1d6a9204cd901f3e71975ccb1f8c5a4cd69bc868abcd375e805b6aa2b8dd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5322d2ea70b251f781672e17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这绝不意味着她对其他赛马娘抱有消极的态度，\n或是落在她们后头……绝对不是那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3ed1a25cfa76ee383bf08b83f0da3cccf1b102bb59925e17b33f8a6358409b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
