    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8213399e7d9d6b095121708",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。为了达到我所追求的高处，必须有能够并肩而行的劲敌。\n这场比较——希望你能接受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9084ad414e98a833a50e18634f99da63340d0651d50f1e7a4a72a0648e2a339",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
