      "uid": "zhcn:7fca09defa3980b8277c26e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多谢指教。果然与劲敌交手总能有所收获。\n正因为比萨能够应战，这场并跑才有了意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28973ee988fe6e316a72fa156997447c4bdcaa2e0d40041dc193c029b67dd44",
