    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a029eec4ec25331d6b015d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哼哼，能帮上大家的忙真是太好了。\n能和大家一起奔跑。对我而言，没有比这更开心的事情了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f490d3a2f6af39c487fd75a007405a2b935de5f80b72cb7f9a693769b7302818",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
