      "uid": "zhcn:bd0b451bc429766a94eb56fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，作为同期中最具天赋的天才，\n在没有明确目的意识的情况下，真的能开出如此绚烂之花吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc87900b1355c04f57283066aa727cfb20f3082dd795f4eb308decc2459d0b92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143002.json",
      "json_path": [
